cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use "ncvgbdt" please cite it with the metadata below. It is based
  on the code and method of David Steyrl (https://github.com/univiemops/iml);
  please also acknowledge that work.
type: software
title: "Interpretable Machine Learning Toolbox (imltools)"
abstract: >-
  Scikit-learn style estimators for tabular regression, binary and multiclass
  problems with grouped observations: LightGBM models evaluated with repeated
  group-wise nested cross-validation, compared against a shuffled-target
  baseline, and explained with SHAP values, effect sizes and figures. Derived
  from the iml scripts by David Steyrl.
authors:
  - family-names: Valko
    given-names: Danila
version: 0.2.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ellariel/imltools"
keywords:
  - interpretable machine learning
  - gradient boosted decision trees
  - LightGBM
  - SHAP
  - nested cross-validation
  - scikit-learn
